<title>USA: BIG Super-Kiosk Nov same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>BIG Super-Kiosk Nov same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>BIG Entertainment Inc said Tuesday its Entertainment Super-Kiosk retail division's same-store sales in November increased 26.3 percent from a year earlier.</p>
<p>Retail sales for all stores for November were up 140 percent from November 1995.</p>
<p>BIG Entertainment is a diversified entertainment company.</p>
</text>
